    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>Instruction</name>
      <id>8</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>To receive messages from Max, you need a bot for your contacts to communicate with.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>If you don't have a bot in Max yet, create one on the &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>Max for partners&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> platform for your company.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>How to create a company profile&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>How to create a bot and get a token&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>برای دریافت پیام از Max، به رباتی نیاز دارید که مخاطبان شما با آن ارتباط برقرار کنند.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>اگر هنوز رباتی در Max ندارید، یکی را در پلتفرم &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>Max for partners&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> برای شرکت خود ایجاد کنید.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>نحوه ایجاد پروفایل شرکت&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>نحوه ایجاد ربات و دریافت توکن&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>Для получения сообщений из Max необходим бот, с которым будут общаться ваши контакты.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>Если у вас в Max еще нет бота, то создайте его на платформе &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>Max для партнеров&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> для вашей организации.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>Как создать профиль организации&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>Как создать бота и получить токен&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>Max'tan mesaj almak için kişilerinizin iletişim kuracağı bir bot gereklidir.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>Eğer Max'ta henüz bir botunuz yoksa, iş yeriniz için &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>İş ortakları için Max&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> platformunda bir tane oluşturun.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000> ●&lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>İş yeri profili nasıl oluşturulur&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>Bot nasıl oluşturulur ve token nasıl alınır&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>To receive messages from Max, you need a bot for your contacts to communicate with.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>If you don't have a bot in Max yet, create one on the &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>Max for partners&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> platform for your company.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>How to create a company profile&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>How to create a bot and get a token&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>To receive messages from Max, you need a bot for your contacts to communicate with.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>If you don't have a bot in Max yet, create one on the &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>Max for partners&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> platform for your company.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>How to create a company profile&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>How to create a bot and get a token&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>&lt;color #000000>To receive messages from Max, you need a bot for your contacts to communicate with.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>If you don't have a bot in Max yet, create one on the &lt;/>&lt;link https://business.max.ru/self>Max for partners&lt;/>&lt;color #000000> platform for your company.&lt;/>

&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/maxbusiness/connection>How to create a company profile&lt;/>
&lt;color #000000>● &lt;/>&lt;link https://dev.max.ru/docs/chatbots/bots-create>How to create a bot and get a token&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
